---
// The Leuchtkern section mark (DESIGN.md §4, placement type 2: one small,
// low-density instance per view) as static markup for pages that must work
// without JavaScript — the 404 page is served for every missed path and
// should not depend on a module loading. Same parametrization as the
// Wegkarte goal mark (phyllotaxis, n=48, r=27, seed 7, src/scripts/bloom.js);
// the hue comes from the colour classes below, so it follows the light and
// dark tokens. Purely decorative: aria-hidden, no title. The identical
// markup lives in packages/community/templates/error/_bloom.html.twig.
---

